---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ContactForm from '../components/ContactForm';
import { PAGE_DESCRIPTIONS } from '../consts/site';
---
<Layout title="About | The Greenhouse" description={PAGE_DESCRIPTIONS.gardener} canonicalPath="/gardener/">
  <main class="journal-about">
    <header><p>THE PERSON BEHIND THE JOURNAL</p><h1>안녕하세요,<br />Bunnykey입니다.</h1><div><p>Junior SW PM. 생활과 기술, 좋아하는 것을 천천히 기록합니다.</p><p>이곳의 글은 개인적인 생각이며, 소속 조직의 견해를 대변하지 않습니다.</p></div></header>
    <section class="about-links"><a href="https://github.com/bunnykey" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>GitHub</span><b>↗</b></a><a href="mailto:sapphire7558@gmail.com"><span>Email</span><b>↗</b></a></section>
    <section class="contact-section"><div><p>WRITE TO ME</p><h2>이야기를<br />나눠요.</h2><p>작업, 질문, 혹은 가벼운 인사를 남겨 주세요.</p></div><div><ContactForm client:visible /></div></section>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style>
  .journal-about { width: min(100% - 2.5rem, 64rem); margin: 0 auto; padding: 5.5rem 0 8rem; } .journal-about header { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; padding-bottom: 5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-outline-subtle); } .journal-about header > p, .contact-section > div > p:first-child { font-size: .66rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; color: var(--color-foreground-muted); } .journal-about h1, .contact-section h2 { grid-column: 1; margin: 0; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.5rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: .92; letter-spacing: -.08em; } .journal-about header > div { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 2; align-self: end; color: var(--color-foreground-muted); line-height: 1.8; } .journal-about header > div p + p { margin-top: 1rem; }.about-links { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-outline-subtle); }.about-links a { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 1.4rem 0; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 1.6rem; }.about-links a + a { padding-left: 2rem; border-left: 1px solid var(--color-outline-subtle); }.contact-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; margin-top: 6rem; }.contact-section h2 { margin: .8rem 0 1.5rem; font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); }.contact-section > div > p:last-child { color: var(--color-foreground-muted); }.contact-section > div:last-child { padding-top: .5rem; } @media (max-width: 640px) { .journal-about { width: min(100% - 2rem, 64rem); padding-top: 3rem; }.journal-about header, .contact-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }.journal-about header > div { grid-column: 1; grid-row: auto; }.about-links { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }.about-links a + a { padding-left: 0; border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-outline-subtle); } }
</style>
